+/*
+ * Patch 0365 (lowclk 2026-11-15, code only: no register access, no new hardware write; research 164 part B1 levers 2 and 3): boot-arg sweetsmbind=<mask> for sm_thread.
+ *   absent / 0 = off, behavior byte-identical to patch 0364 (the thread is still made by kernel_thread_start, never bound; the only additions are never-taken branches).
+ *   bit 0 (1): bind sm_thread to the cpu that takes the GPU JOB SPI. Every sweet SPI is routed to GICD_IROUTER affinity 0.0.0.0 = the boot CPU (pexpert/arm/pe_fiq.c:336, comment :234
